<title>USA: FINAL PRICING -- N.Y. Dorm Authority $6.8 mln deal.</title>
<headline>FINAL PRICING -- N.Y. Dorm Authority $6.8 mln deal.</headline>
<text>
<p>DORMITORY AUTHORITY OF THE STATE OF NEW YORK</p>
<p>RE: $6,800,000</p>
<p>THE ARDEN HILL LIFE CARE CENTER,INC.</p>
<p>FHA-INSURED MORTGAGE</p>
<p>NURSING HOME REVENUE BONDS, SERIES 1997</p>
<p>REGISTERED</p>
<p>WRITTEN AWARD.</p>
<p>TRADE DATE WILL BE TOMORROW JUNE 12, 1997</p>
<p>PLS NOTE:  S&amp;P RATINGS UPGRADED TO AAA</p>
<p>    MOODY'S: NR		  S&amp;P: AAA</p>
<p>    DATED: 06/01/1997	  FIRST COUPON: 02/01/1998</p>
<p>DUE: 08/01</p>
<p>ALL BONDS ARE PRICED AT PAR.</p>
<p> MATURITY		AMOUNT     COUPON</p>
<p>08/01/2026		6,800M    5.85  %</p>
<p>				    (Super Sinker)</p>
<p>(Avg. Life: 18.333 years based on 100% of FHA experience)</p>
<p>CALL FEATURES: 08/01/2007    102.00</p>
<p>The compliance addendum MSRB Rule G-11 will apply.</p>
<p>The award is expected Wednesday, June 11, 1997.</p>
<p>Delivery is firm for June 25, 1997.</p>
<p>This issue is not book entry.</p>
<p>This issue is clearing through DTC.</p>
<p>Smith Barney Inc.</p>
<p>Herbert J. Sims &amp; Co., Inc.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
